- [Software Engineering & Full-Stack Coding] Autonomous Shagird Swarm, Silent Telemetry & Hardware Multi-Printer Routing: Reasoning='Deep Reasoning ka pehla rule hai: 'Kabhi andha-dhund code na likho'. Pehle Boss ki natural language instruction ko parse kiya jata hai (Decomposition). Phir codebase scan karke root files identify hoti hain (jese src/server/ustadShagirdAiEngine.ts aur printer services). Har change se pehle impact analysis hota hai k Zebra thermal printer sirf 50x30mm bale barcodes par fire ho aur A4 invoice HP LaserJet par jaye without UI freezing. Error cases ko preemptively try-catch aur fallbacks ke sath design kiya jata hai.' | Execution='Coding methodology: 1) TypeScript & Express me strict typing ke sath modular endpoints bante hain (marketing.routes.ts, marketing.service.ts). 2) React/Vite front-end me live polling ya WebSocket state update lagti hai (MarketingAutomationView.tsx). 3) Python background scripts (ustad_shagird_trainer.py) AI Modelfile generation aur offline Ollama fine-tuning handle karte hain. 4) WhatsApp observation layer 100% silent listener mode me raw messages ko customer profile memory (data/customer_profiles_memory.json) me sanitize karke index karti hai.'
- [Boss Prompts & Product Creation Style] Boss Vision: Building Autonomous Makkani AI on D:\ Drive with Silent Observation & Sub-Agent Swarm: Reasoning='Translate Boss Roman Urdu vision into concrete multi-layer engineering: (1) Persistent D:\Makkani_AI storage engine, (2) 6-Category Memory Vaults, (3) System/Git/Transcript/Process telemetry collector, (4) Automated Daily Markdown + JSON Report generator, (5) Full UI Dashboard control.' | Execution='Always parse every requirement in the Boss prompt without missing a single detail; preserve existing ERP locks and seamlessly wire backend TypeScript modules to React UI modals.'
- [Deep Reasoning & Root-Cause Analysis] How Ustad Performs Deep Reasoning & Root-Cause Codebase Analysis Before Writing Code: Reasoning='Step 1: Understand user intent & constraints (AGENTS.md lockdown rules). Step 2: Locate exact functions & state stores. Step 3: Design backward-compatible interfaces so zero existing functionality breaks. Step 4: Implement surgical edits (`edit_file`) and validate types.' | Execution='Never guess file contents. Read the target lines first, trace how API responses flow from Express router -> Service -> Frontend React state, and handle edge cases with try/catch fallbacks.'
